G-HARNESS-TOOLCALL-E2E -- live ephemeral tool calling on the served Gemma-4-12B (2026-06-25)
==============================================================================================
The model emits <tool name="...">{json}</tool> in plain text; the harness parses it,
executes the matching Python callable, feeds the result back, and re-prompts (ReAct loop,
run_with_tools). No native tool channel needed -- ephemeral text protocol. Live on the
resident sp-daemon (:3000) through the gateway proven in G-HARNESS-DAEMON-E2E.

Repro: python tests/g_tool_calling_e2e.py   (daemon up on :3000)

TOOLS (Python callables -> ToolSpec.from_callable, schema derived from signature):
  - calculate(expression): safe arithmetic eval (no builtins)
  - run_python(code): execute model-written Python in a sandboxed subprocess (10s timeout),
    return stdout/stderr

